1416..1492 Comment "/// The presented integers as a model of the shape: `base` zero, a value, as"
1493..1570 Comment "/// the theory\'s `base : Pt` is a constant; `turn` the successor and `unturn`"
1571..1648 Comment "/// the predecessor. Each law is proved by `here`: conversion reads the inner"
1649..1725 Comment "/// call under the constructor the outer one builds, and the integers\' rules"
1726..1746 Comment "/// cancel the pair."
